of Funchal, on the island of Madeira, which serves as the official residence and office of the president of the Regional Government of the Autonomous Region of Madeira.","wpu":"Quinta Vigia","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Funchal%2C_Quinta_Vigia_%28south_balcony%29.jpg/960px-Funchal%2C_Quinta_Vigia_%28south_balcony%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Infante D. Henrique","g":"sights","k":"artwork","la":32.646418,"lo":-16.91316,"d":289},{"n":"Teatro Municipal Baltazar Dias","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":32.646944,"lo":-16.911418,"d":331,"w":"https://teatrobaltazardias.funchal.pt/","wp":"pt:Teatro Municipal Baltazar Dias"},{"n":"Santa Maria de Colombo","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":32.645701,"lo":-16.908841,"d":351,"ph":"+351291220327"},{"n":"Museu Militar da Madeira","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":32.647038,"lo":-16.910191,"d":377,"h":"Mo-Fr 10:00-16:30","w":"https://cultura.madeira.gov.pt/museu-militar-da-madeira.html"},{"n":"Casino da Madeira","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":32.643968,"lo":-16.916082,"d":382,"wp":"en:Casino da Madeira","ds":"Casino da Madeira (Casino of Madeira) is a casino located in Funchal, Madeira, Portugal, which is part of the hotel Pestana Casino Park. It was designed in 1966, but work did not begin until six years later, and it opened in 1976. While popularly attributed to Brazilian architect Oscar Niemeyer, it was in fact co-designed by Viana de Lima, a Portuguese architect from Esposende.","wpu":"Casino da Madeira","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Casino-Funchal.jpg/960px-Casino-Funchal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Forte de São Lourenço","g":"sights","k":"fort","la":32.647259,"lo":-16.910264,"d":397},{"n":"Núcleo Museológico do Palácio de São Lourenço","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":32.647282,"lo":-16.91026,"d":399,"w":"http://www.visitmadeira.pt/pt-pt/explorar/detalhe